  "lead_time": 25.415,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 19,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "whenever you’re ready",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8CFFE94566",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 13,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "There's so much debate right now about what companies and countries should be doing on climate.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "547A7FB150",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "Nature is actually the best benchmark.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E61C7560D9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "Why don't we just follow what it would do?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3371C8857B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "Nature has 3.8 billion years of R and D under its belt.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0F0A7E2A45",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 12,
        "text": "you know",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D4BBA01A11",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "Nature can do complex chemistry, really interesting engineering.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "84E68761F1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 336,
        "text": "And so how can we look to nature and really harness what we know works to provide solutions for business to be more sustainable? [In the Green: The Business of Climate Action] [Presented by: TED Countdown and The Climate Pledge] [Erin Meezan; Company: Interface; Sector: Manufacturing; Location: USA] This is a carpet tile that we make.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9166961816",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "We operate in the building and construction space, which is close to 40 percent of global carbon emissions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C9EE13AFF9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "So in that space, we’re putting a lot of materials, like flooring, into buildings.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F5D7323450",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "When we started on sustainability as a company, most of these products had a significant impact on the planet.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "305F2BF114",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 129,
        "text": "We wasted a lot of resources, we recycled nothing, and they had a carbon footprint that we had never even measured or understood.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6A08E0BCD9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "Interface became inspired to take the company in a more sustainable direction.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "842534EADE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 61,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "How would nature design a floor?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ED290D8763",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "What lessons could nature give us",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1A706B043A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 92,
        "endOffset": 117,
        "text": "took the company off glue",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "26349E3EFC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 175,
        "endOffset": 193,
        "text": "inspired by nature",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D3C1A11582",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 194,
        "text": "And that led to an exploration of gecko's feet that allowed us to design an innovation that took the company off glue and really helped us build a whole new business by being inspired by nature.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7BDEC9C9B3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "We did things to reduce waste.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "19A23D0ED2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "We've swapped out less sustainable materials for recycled and bio-based materials.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "40CD9E4CFC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 156,
        "text": "And so over 20 years, we've been able to innovate and create something that actually stores more carbon than it emits, has a net benefit to the environment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ACCBB906E6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "We really challenged ourselves to say, what's beyond that?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E505B03116",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "Could we create a factory that has a positive impact, and what might that look like?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "93B1C3401A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "Nature, for example, harvests and collects and purifies rainwater.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "13B7E09357",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "Nature, for example, harvests and collects and purifies rainwater.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7E3C57FD5A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 172,
        "text": "So what we've done in some of our factory locations is install rainwater collection devices to be able to take that rainwater out, use that in our manufacturing operations.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A6F94AEA50",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "Nature stores carbon.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A1E56F5BAC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 190,
        "text": "And so we have opportunities onsite through planting, possibly removal of parking lots, possibly by establishing green roofs, to store carbon on-site and in the buildings within our company.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0D69202219",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "And I'm really excited now that it's not just Interface trying to figure this out.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "72D0276584",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "Other companies started to hear us talking about it and got really interested in it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "300EF7104D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 3,
        "endOffset": 149,
        "text": "could share the work that we had done, and other companies could accelerate their learning, but also they committed to share what they were doing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "93EED85FCD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 149,
        "text": "We could share the work that we had done, and other companies could accelerate their learning, but also they committed to share what they were doing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9C1E4BC11B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "And we're hopeful that this will continue to pick up momentum.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4DDB24722D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 39,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "What’s your carbon-negative carpet tile?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "57FF4FB809",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "I think the question for everybody is: What’s your carbon-negative carpet tile?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "579E588A27",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 27,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "sustainable carpet tile to a sustainable building to a sustainable city",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "24538A7904",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 51,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "to a sustainable",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AF3CA34878",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "If we're going to meaningfully address global warming",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B9A248D60A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
